## GIT STRATEGY

### Branch Naming

Format:

```bash
feature/{module}-{task}
```

Examples:

```bash
feature/auth-otp
feature/product-search
feature/inventory-lock
feature/payment-webhook
```

### Rules

- No direct commits to `main`
- All changes must go through PR review
- Preferred PR size: <400 LOC
- Squash merge enabled

Every PR must:
- pass CI
- pass lint
- pass tests
- include migration notes (if applicable)
- update docs if architecture changes

### Commit Philosophy

Preferred:
- small commits
- single-responsibility commits
- descriptive commit messages

Examples:

```bash
feat(auth): add otp verification endpoint
fix(order): resolve inventory race condition
docs(runtime): update deployment strategy
```

Avoid:
- giant commits
- mixed concerns
- undocumented migrations
- force pushes on shared branches


